            "failure_scenario": "Auto-merge is armed and waits on workspace-test. The receipt commit this review pushes re-triggers CI on the new tip, so the red run is superseded rather than re-run; if yoga-build2 kills the container again (an OOM or runner reset, cause not visible from the log) the PR sits armed and unmerged with the operator away, and nothing in this repository distinguishes 'tests failed' from 'the box killed the build' in the check's red X. A reader who sees only the X on a 7-file config PR will look for the defect in the diff, where it is not."
          }
        }
